{"login": "xuanranran", "location": null, "commits": [{"sha": "c9bebcd2f0ba2072f10095cf2128cbdb5d953892", "message": "Remove ads geosite rule and DNS entry\n\nDelete references to the geosite category-ads-all from Clash/ClashRule_NoGroups.ini and Clash/base_NoGroups.yaml. This removes the REJECT ruleset line and the corresponding DNS geosite entry, cleaning up ad-blocking configuration and preventing the category-ads-all geosite from being applied via ruleset or DNS mapping.", "created_at": "2026-03-29T06:41:07Z", "repo": "Clash", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "5e40549fd065b59985c4ccb1c662864af9a4aa9e", "message": "Update base_NoGroups.yaml", "created_at": "2026-03-29T06:37:31Z", "repo": "Clash", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "42684c79378f8adbf91a94aa1890bfb4d5270552", "message": "Add Clash no-groups rule and base configs\n\nAdd two new Clash configuration files: Clash/ClashRule_NoGroups.ini and Clash/base_NoGroups.yaml. The INI defines custom proxy groups, rulesets, emoji mappings, parser/userinfo rules and various flags for rule generation and node filtering (including overwrite_original_rules and a remote clash_rule_base). The YAML provides a complete base Clash config (ports, controllers, DNS with fake-ip and multiple nameserver/fallback policies, geodata sources, experimental flags, sniffer settings and other runtime/preferences). These files provision a ready-to-use \u201cno groups\u201d Clash setup and centralized defaults for rule generation and DNS behavior.", "created_at": "2026-03-29T06:32:48Z", "repo": "Clash", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "cda904cc5a78eed32c6e805eaef0c1f9f929cb19", "message": "Remove tls:// prefix from DNS nameserver\n\nUpdate Clash configs (Clash/base.yaml and Clash/base_stash.yaml) to replace `tls://223.5.5.5:853` with `223.5.5.5:853` in the default-nameserver entries. This aligns the nameserver entries with a bare IP:port format and fixes potential parsing/format issues related to the protocol prefix.", "created_at": "2026-03-23T09:33:59Z", "repo": "Clash", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "dbfcd6c24e97d21cd0aafb50158be6862f7ede53", "message": "Update Proxy_Groups_Smart_Personal.yml", "created_at": "2026-03-23T04:11:49Z", "repo": "Clash", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "371af8e83e865d41146eaaa1a9e0ee685dfbac54", "message": "Update base.yaml", "created_at": "2026-03-07T14:29:09Z", "repo": "Clash", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "12b832b2f4ceef61aae795c58349ab7de8c43bbf", "message": "Update Proxy_Groups_Smart_Personal.yml", "created_at": "2026-03-04T13:04:16Z", "repo": "Clash", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "fbb817ba75adef3118e213c8b2eb4b88a4a75423", "message": "Update Proxy_Groups_Smart_Personal.yml", "created_at": "2026-02-27T16:17:35Z", "repo": "Clash", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "bc88f08a348165eae2cc87158fa9a7d94e18f065", "message": "Update Proxy_Groups_Smart_Personal.yml", "created_at": "2026-02-26T05:02:15Z", "repo": "Clash", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "13da3847e0555a3da7b881fea4c3dbb88b55f8b2", "message": "Update Proxy_Groups_Smart_Personal_2.yml", "created_at": "2026-02-23T14:59:02Z", "repo": "Clash", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "40adcdf1bf9b8d4d9e97136ab92a9cce767b4684", "message": "Update Proxy_Groups_Smart_Personal.yml", "created_at": "2026-02-23T14:53:51Z", "repo": "Clash", "file_sampled": false, "has_test_file": null, "has_impl_file": null}, {"sha": "9a87b0768fb1d8a28c8f0a2b22cdaca66c7fc340", "message": "Revert \"Update base.yaml\"\n\nThis reverts commit 6974c407fc2fdcd1024fff412991dccac15c9415.", "created_at